DESCRIPTION:Event Name: Exclusive Executive Networking Event\nEvent Desc
 ription: Click on any of the available dates and times to register.Kurt 
 Phelps is the Founder of Global Network Recruiting and Phello LLC. Mr. P
 helps has over 25 years of experience as an executive recruiter and has 
 personally worked with over 10\,000 corporate executives in helping them
  build their brand. As an Executive Recruiter\, Kurt has worked with com
 panies like Google\, Microsoft\, and many other Fortune 500 Companies to
  fill key leadership roles.\nDate & Time: 02:00pm - 03:00pm (Eastern Tim
 e - US & Canada) on Wednesday\, November 6\, 2024\nLocation: This is a Z
 oom web conference.\n\nYou can join this meeting from your computer\, ta
 blet\, or smartphone.\nhttps://us02web.zoom.us/j/82736626994\n\nYou can 
 also dial in using your phone.\nUS: +1 646 558 8656\, +1 646 931 3860\, 
 +1 301 715 8592\, +1 305 224 1968\, +1 309 205 3325\, +1 312 626 6799\, 
 +1 253 215 8782\, +1 346 248 7799\, +1 360 209 5623\, +1 386 347 5053\, 
 +1 507 473 4847\, +1 564 217 2000\, +1 669 444 9171\, +1 669 900 6833\, 
 +16892781000\, +1 719 359 4580\, +1 253 205 0468\nMeeting ID: 827-366-26
 994\n\nFind your local number: https://us02web.zoom.us/u/kbJaf11nDv\n\nM
 obile Number: +1 909-720-7964\n\nLinkedIn Profile Link/URL: : linkedin.c
 om/in/stesvedrohan\n\nNeed to make changes to this event?\nCancel: https
 ://calendly.com/cancellations/5b74a26e-01d9-4cac-98a6-90581163190c\nResc
 hedule: https://calendly.com/reschedulings/5b74a26e-01d9-4cac-98a6-90581
 163190c\n
