 //scheduler.thirdbridge.com/availability/564b3c85bd391aad2848df6f2bb28a5
 656cac134\nIf you have any questions\, please contact:\nLayne Meyer\nlay
 ne.meyer@thirdbridge.com\n1 646 979 6209\n------------------------------
 --------------\n<b>Please read the following reminders prior to joining 
 the consultation:</b>\nThe use of Generative AI (GenAI) tools\, such as 
 chatbots\, content generators\, or any other AI-powered solutions\, is s
 trictly prohibited. Any specialist found using GenAI may face permanent 
 exclusion from Third Bridge's network and further legal action.\nEnsure 
 you do not disclose any confidential or material non-public information\
 , provide investment\, legal\, financial\, accountancy\, or medical advi
 ce\, share inside information or trade secrets\, or reveal any informati
 on you are obligated to keep confidential by agreement or otherwise.\nYo
 u may decline to answer any questions during the consultation for any re
 ason and you should always do so if your answer would lead to a conflict
  of interest\, breach of third-party obligations or disclosure of confid
 ential or material non-public information.\nBy participating in this con
 sultation\, you agree not to discuss any information related to your cur
 rent employer or any company by which you are engaged if such informatio
 n could reasonably be considered to be proprietary\, confidential\, or c
 onstitute a trade secret and you warrant that your participation does no
 t breach any existing agreements\, or legal duties\, or contravene any a
 pplicable laws or regulations. \nIf you are a franchisee owner\, you may
  discuss your own franchise or the general industry\, however\, you may 
 not discuss information related to the franchisor's internal financial p
 erformance\, strategic plans\, new product development\, or any other ma
 tter which is likely to reveal confidential information about the franch
 isor.\nIn addition\, you must not disclose or discuss (i) information re
 lating to China’s national security and interests\,(ii) non-public stati
 stical data related to the Chinese economy or market\,or (iii) other imp
 ortant data related to the Chinese economy or market. \nYou are also obl
 igated to maintain confidentiality by not disclosing to anythird party t
 he client's identity\, any information provided by the client\,or the su
 bject matter of the consultation.\nYou must not exchange contact details
  with the client and must notify Third Bridge immediately if you areaske
 d by a client to provide your contact details. \nShould you become aware
  of any conflict of interest\, any breach of law\, regulation\, professi
 onalconduct rules or confidentiality\, or any disclosure of material non
 -publicinformation concerning a quoted company or instrument or any trad
 e secret\,please terminate the consultation immediately and notify Third
  Bridge Compliance at <a href="mailto:compliance@thirdbridge.com">compli
 ance@thirdbridge.com</a>.\n<b>在正式参与访谈咨询前，请阅读以下提示：</b>\n严禁使用人工智能生成（GenAI）
 工具，如聊天机器人、内容生成器或任何其他人工智能驱动的解决方案。任何使用人工智能生成工具的专家可能会被永久排除在高临的网络之外，并面临进一步的法
 律诉讼。\n确保您不披露任何机密或重大非公开信息，不提供投资、法律、财务、会计或医疗建议，不分享内幕信息或商业秘密，不披露任何您根据协议或其他方
 式负有保密义务的信息。\n您可以在咨询期间以任何理由拒绝回答任何问题，如果您的回答会导致利益冲突、违反第三方义务、披露机密和重大非公开信息，您应
 该始终拒绝回应。\n通过参与本次咨询，您同意不讨论与您当前雇主或您所在的任何公司有关的任何信息，如果该信息被合理地视为专有、机密或构成商业秘密，
 请保证您的参与不会违反任何现有协议或法律义务，也不会违反任何适用的法律或法规。\n如果您是加盟商所有者，您可以讨论自己的特许经营权或行业，但不得
 讨论与特许人的内部财务业绩、战略计划、新产品研发或任何其他可能泄露特许人机密信息的相关信息。\n此外，您不得披露或讨论（i）与中国国家安全和利益
 有关的信息，（ii）与中国经济或市场有关的非公开统计数据，（iii）任何与中国经济和市场有关的重要数据。\n您还负有保密义务，即不向任何第三方披
 露客户的身份、客户提供的任何信息或咨询的主题。\n您不得与客户交换联系方式，如果客户向您索要联系方式，您必须立即通知高临。\n如果您发现任何利益
 冲突，任何违反法律、法规、职业行为准则或保密规定，任何披露有关上市公司或文书的重大非公开信息及任何商业秘密，请立即终止咨询，并向高临合规部门报告
